/**
 * @example tutorial.dox
 *
 * @par [en] PCD measurement example
 *     This example reads one empty-tray frame and one food frame, then prints the observed,
 *     filled, and total volume. Check both PCD reads before running the pipeline. A successful
 *     result can still contain inferred cells; inspect `interpolated_cells` and
 *     `missing_baseline_cells` when reviewing a scan.
 * @par [zh] PCD 测量示例
 *     示例读取一帧空烤盘和一帧食材点云，分别打印实测、补洞和总体积。运行前先检查两个
 *     PCD 是否读取成功。即使状态为成功，结果也可能含推算栅格；检查
 *     `interpolated_cells` 和 `missing_baseline_cells` 可帮助判断输入质量。
 *
 * @include demo.cxx
 *
 * @note [en] Link against `food3d_im::food3d_im` when consuming the
 *     installed CMake package. Input points default to metres; change the input unit for
 *     millimetre PCD files. ROI bounds and distance parameters remain in metres.
 * @note [zh] 使用已安装的 CMake 包时链接 `food3d_im::food3d_im`。
 *     点云默认以米为单位；毫米 PCD 需修改输入单位。ROI 边界和距离参数仍以米表示。
 */
